  "prior_expectation": "KCC2 is the neuronal K-Cl cotransporter that maintains low intracellular chloride, and SLC12A5 loss of function is linked to epilepsy; WNK-SPAK/OSR1 regulation of cation-chloride cotransporters is expected to act heavily through phosphorylation and chloride flux rather than necessarily through cotransporter mRNA abundance.",
